WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.004
Quinte West, Ontario — population forty-six thousand, encompassing Trenton, Frankford, Batawa, Murray, and Sidney.

00:00:06.954 --> 00:00:15.261
The Integrity Commissioner investigated Mayor Jim Harrison and found a Code of Conduct violation following a 2023 altercation with a councillor.

00:00:15.261 --> 00:00:23.818
A twelve-member council, four wards, two integrity investigations — even in a small Ontario municipality, the pattern of governance failure repeats.

00:00:23.818 --> 00:00:27.022
No community is too small for accountability.
